M09_Mobius_Follow catch-up loop restart. The 5 s TOO_FAR loop (walk to
Havoc when 25 m or more away) re-arms only while following, so NO_FOLLOW ON
from zone 1100238 ends it for good unless OFF arrives inside 5 s. Record the
stop and restart the loop once on NO_FOLLOW OFF (zone 2000991). A loop that
is still running is left alone, so repeated OFF events cannot start a second
loop. Saved as id 12; older saves read false and keep the retail behaviour.

